This product includes third-party software, third-party data and third-party artwork, listed
below with its licence. Nothing here is bundled without a licence that permits redistribution. The
same list is reachable inside the app, under Data, backup and privacy, because Apache-2.0 section
4(d) asks for the notice to travel with the distribution and an app bundle has nowhere else to put
it.

The only third-party code in the iOS build is libjxl and the three libraries it links, built from
pinned sources by tools/fetch-deps.sh and tools/build-libjxl.sh and statically linked through the
LimenJxl framework. Everything else is Swift, SwiftUI and Apple's own frameworks, which is why the
Android notice's entries for AndroidX, the Kotlin standard library, kotlinx.serialization and
AndroidSVG have no counterpart here.

